            "id": "4945925",
            "title": "Solaris Energy Infrastructure: Liftoff Velocity Achieved, Orbit Is Years Down The Road",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Skybox Power Campus planned for 4 million square feet in Hutto, Texas and 600MW\" data-id=\"2271146207\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"631\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2271146207/image_2271146207.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"></p> <p class=\"item-credits\">BackyardProduction/iStock Editorial via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Introduction</h2> <p>I have discussed the Energy as a Service-EaaS, behind the meter power delivery in a couple of articles recently. From Schlumberger, (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SLB\" title=\"SLB N.V.\">SLB</a>) to Flotek Industries, (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.co