            "id": "4946222",
            "title": "Arbor Realty: It's A Miracle It Hasn't Dropped More",
            "description": "<html><body><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Hand arranging wooden letter blocks spelling REIT on a bright background. Concept of real estate investment trusts, property investing, passive income and portfolio diversification.\" data-id=\"2285251700\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285251700/image_2285251700.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption data-type=\"getty-image\"><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Akmal Hazim bin Khalit/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure> <h3>Investment Thesis</h3> <p data-eci=\"true\">I’m not one to share the bullishness or even neutral stance some have on Arbor Realty (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ABR\" title=\"Arbor Realty Trust, Inc.\">ABR</a></span>). It might look appealing with the yield now at 14.41%, but how reliable is it? It already cut the dividend by over</p></body></html>",
